PvNP.RealizableHardness.ActualBinaryMatrixHC46DR6Mobius.dr6QFactorial (n : ℕ) : ℕ
PvNP.RealizableHardness.ActualBinaryMatrixHC46DR6Mobius.dr6QFactorial_pos (n : ℕ) : 0 < dr6QFactorial n
PvNP.RealizableHardness.ActualBinaryMatrixHC46DR6Mobius.dr6QFactorial_succ (n : ℕ) :
